      ],
      "source": "https://www.digital-desert.wrightwoodcalifornia.com/hoover-dam/history.html",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hoover’s downtown features a historic train depot that once served the Southern Pacific line, a reminder of the town’s early rail connections.",
